  "keyword_lines": [
    "06. DPC (Dam Proof Course) to be laid under all walls and",
    "09. 500mm gauge polythene, DPM (Damp Proof",
    "under ground floor concrete slab.",
    "02. All reinforced concrete to be grade 25 mix giving a",
    "ff. cement/sand screed",
    "Engineer for inspection prior to concreting.",
    "Structural Engineer for his approval prior to placing of",
    "the Structural Engineer shall be consulted before final",
    "02. 40mm to columns above ground level.",
    "AREA in M2",
    "FLOOR AREA",
    "VERANDAH",
    "ff. cement/sand screed",
