    "PLAN : FLOOR LAYOUT"
  ],
  "keyword_blocks": [
    {
      "text": "01. All dimensions are in millimeters. 02. All dimensions should be checked on site and any discrepancies be reported to the Architect. 03. All works to be carried in acccordance with the Local Authority Standards. 04. Use figured dimensions only, do not scale from the drawing. 05. Walls to be reinforced with hoop iron at every alternative course. 06. DPC (Dam Proof Course) to be laid under all walls and should be minimum 150mm above finished ground level. 200",
      "bbox": [
        133.97,
        76.73,
        801.18,
        145.14
      ],
      "block_no": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "07. All drainage pipes passing under buildings and drive way to be encased in 150mm concrete sorround. 08. All inspection chambers in drive ways to be heavy duty covers. 09. 500mm gauge polythene, DPM (Damp Proof Membrane) and anti-termite treatment to be provided under ground floor concrete slab. 10. No alterations should be made whatsover without the consent of the Architect.",
      "bbox": [
        701.47,
        135.08,
        801.66,
        178.79
      ],
      "block_no": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "CONCRETE 01. Blinding under Pad foundation shall be 1:4:8 mix. 02. All reinforced concrete to be grade 25 mix giving a minimum crushing strength of 25 N/mm2 of 28 days. 03. Cement shall be Portland Cement to comply with BS 12.",
      "bbox": [
        701.47,
        181.47,
        797.56,
        210.26
      ],
      "block_no": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "LABORATORY ff. cement/sand screed",
      "bbox": [
        290.23,
        360.58,
        349.48,
        377.04
      ],
      "block_no": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "Engineer for inspection prior to concreting.",
      "bbox": [
        708.43,
        237.42,
        781.48,
        241.94
      ],
      "block_no": 47
    },
    {
      "text": "EXCAVATIONS 01. All excavations for foundation shall be presented to the Structural Engineer for his approval prior to placing of blinding. 2 02. Depth of foundation on all drawings are provisional and the Structural Engineer shall be consulted before final depth is carried during construction.",
      "bbox": [
        631.63,
        244.62,
        803.58,
        278.44
      ],
      "block_no": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "COVER Unless otherwise stated, cover to main steel shall be as follows :- 01. 50mm to all steel below ground level. 02. 40mm to columns above ground level. 03. 25mm to steel in beams. 04. 20mm to steel in slabs and staircase.",
      "bbox": [
        701.23,
